1034
01:10:53.899 --> 01:10:57.264
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bisakah kaubuka topeng
demi segelas kopi?</b></font>

1035
01:10:58.042 --> 01:11:01.576
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan baper. Frank
Kubuka bukan untuk siapa pun.</b></font>

1036
01:11:01.876 --> 01:11:02.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Untuknya pun tidak?</b></font>

1037
01:11:05.129 --> 01:11:07.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Siapa dia?
- Entahlah.</b></font>

1038
01:11:08.209 --> 01:11:09.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bacot. Siapa dia?</b></font>

1039
01:11:09.509 --> 01:11:11.097
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sungguh. aku tak tahu siapa dia.</b></font>

1040
01:11:11.292 --> 01:11:12.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan sok cuek.</b></font>

1041
01:11:13.202 --> 01:11:16.201
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tak mengenalnya.
Aku sebatang kara sepertimu.</b></font>

1042
01:11:16.321 --> 01:11:17.451
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku penyendiri.</b></font>

1043
01:11:17.608 --> 01:11:18.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sepertiku?</b></font>

1044
01:11:20.042 --> 01:11:21.501
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kautahu apa tentangku?</b></font>

1045
01:11:22.209 --> 01:11:23.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kaukira ini pilihan?</b></font>

1046
01:11:24.126 --> 01:11:26.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sebuah gaya hidup. begitu?</b></font>

1047
01:11:26.709 --> 01:11:28.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini kutukan.</b></font>

1048
01:11:29.245 --> 01:11:30.472
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Asal kautahu saja.</b></font>

1049
01:11:31.042 --> 01:11:34.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jika orang yang kucintai
masih hidup.</b></font>

1050
01:11:34.683 --> 01:11:36.963
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kaukira aku sudi bertopeng.</b></font>

1051
01:11:37.126 --> 01:11:40.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>memalsukan identitas
bagai pengecut?</b></font>

1052
01:11:43.980 --> 01:11:46.267
<font color="#26ff77"><b>PERINGATAN</b></font>

1053
01:11:46.292 --> 01:11:47.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ditemukan kecocokan wajah.</b></font>

1054
01:11:51.709 --> 01:11:54.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia di markas Damage Control
Manhattan.</b></font>

1055
01:11:54.151 --> 01:11:55.248
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku harus pergi.</b></font>

1056
01:11:55.273 --> 01:11:56.329
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Oke.</b></font>

1057
01:12:00.126 --> 01:12:01.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia aman bersamaku.</b></font>

1058
01:12:02.162 --> 01:12:03.755
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Andalkan aku.</b></font>

1059
01:12:06.518 --> 01:12:07.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Terima kasih. Frank.</b></font>

1060
01:12:14.720 --> 01:12:16.953
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hei.</b></font>

1061
01:12:18.959 --> 01:12:20.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kaubiarkan dia pergi sendiri?</b></font>

1062
01:12:22.187 --> 01:12:23.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kurasa dia butuh bantuanmu.</b></font>

1063
01:12:24.051 --> 01:12:25.391
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sial.</b></font>

1064
01:12:26.459 --> 01:12:28.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Seperti kasusmu di Staten Island.</b></font>

1065
01:12:49.618 --> 01:12:51.624
<font color="#26ff77"><b>V-MAX</b></font>

1066
01:12:51.649 --> 01:12:52.371
<font color="#26ff77"><b>BERKAS KASUS</b></font>

1067
01:12:54.634 --> 01:12:55.688
<font color="#26ff77"><b>TIDAK ADA HASIL</b></font>

1068
01:13:11.792 --> 01:13:13.805
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau pasti kutangkap. Bill.</b></font>

1069
01:13:14.542 --> 01:13:18.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b><i>Pintumu kebal.
tapi awas dindingnya.</i></b></font>

1070
01:13:18.792 --> 01:13:20.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa kau dan apa maumu?</b></font>

1071
01:13:25.876 --> 01:13:27.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namaku Jean Grey.</b></font>

1072
01:13:28.126 --> 01:13:29.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kautahu apa mauku.</b></font>

1073
01:14:32.126 --> 01:14:33.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jean?</b></font>

1074
01:14:33.959 --> 01:14:35.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau membuntutiku?</b></font>

1075
01:14:35.542 --> 01:14:36.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Membuatku geer saja.</b></font>

1076
01:14:37.876 --> 01:14:41.063
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudah kubilang
kau membahayakan pacarmu.</b></font>

1077
01:14:41.376 --> 01:14:43.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jauhi dia.</b></font>

1078
01:14:43.709 --> 01:14:45.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan kau takkan bisa menembus brankasnya.</b></font>

1079
01:14:46.376 --> 01:14:47.489
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mungkin tidak.</b></font>

1080
01:14:55.002 --> 01:14:56.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku kenal orang yang sanggup.</b></font>

1081
01:14:59.698 --> 01:15:00.351
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jean?</b></font>

1082
01:15:00.376 --> 01:15:01.995
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tak tahu perbuatanmu.</b></font>

1083
01:15:02.292 --> 01:15:04.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Banner dan dirimu
 punya kesamaan.</b></font>

1084
01:15:05.126 --> 01:15:09.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berjuang sia-sia
melawan monster di dalam diri.</b></font>

1085
01:15:09.792 --> 01:15:11.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jean. jangan Hulk...</b></font>

1086
01:15:11.149 --> 01:15:11.942
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tak bisa...</b></font>

1087
01:15:20.459 --> 01:15:21.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Benda apa itu?</b></font>

1088
01:15:23.376 --> 01:15:24.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Oh. aku paham.</b></font>

1089
01:15:26.843 --> 01:15:30.369
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau mau melumpuhkanku
seperti halnya dirimu?</b></font>

1090
01:15:30.542 --> 01:15:31.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau dilarang masuk.</b></font>

1091
01:15:32.126 --> 01:15:34.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>V-Max takkan jatuh ke tanganmu.</b></font>

1092
01:15:34.876 --> 01:15:36.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kaukira begitu?</b></font>

1093
01:15:36.867 --> 01:15:37.707
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Anjir!</b></font>

1094
01:15:49.394 --> 01:15:51.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jean. jangan!</b></font>

1095
01:15:51.792 --> 01:15:53.314
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan buang tenagamu.</b></font>

1096
01:16:17.447 --> 01:16:18.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Frank. sedang apa kau?</b></font>

1097
01:16:19.126 --> 01:16:20.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Menyelamatkan nyawamu.</b></font>

1098
01:16:20.727 --> 01:16:23.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau bukan tandingan Hulk.</b></font>

1099
01:16:23.281 --> 01:16:24.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Anjir!</b></font>

1100
01:16:45.902 --> 01:16:46.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bercanda kau?</b></font>

1101
01:16:58.320 --> 01:16:59.200
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lepaskan aku!</b></font>

1102
01:17:05.537 --> 01:17:07.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Jangan tembak!
- Kau gila?</b></font>

1103
01:17:07.792 --> 01:17:09.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ancaman aslinya bukan Banner.
Tapi dia.</b></font>

1104
01:17:23.292 --> 01:17:25.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Tugasmu lindungi MJ.
- Benar.</b></font>

1105
01:17:25.959 --> 01:17:27.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun dia menyuruhku menjagamu.</b></font>

1106
01:17:29.090 --> 01:17:30.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia bilang begitu?</b></font>

1107
01:17:31.483 --> 01:17:33.224
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau geer. ya?</b></font>

1108
01:17:33.510 --> 01:17:34.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mana mungkin.</b></font>

1109
01:17:44.459 --> 01:17:47.046
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Anjir. harusnya kubawa
senapan besar.</b></font>

1110
01:17:47.126 --> 01:17:49.336
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hebat!
Mau menggelitikinya sampai mati?</b></font>

1111
01:17:49.542 --> 01:17:53.424
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ganti taktik.
Pasang ini ke Hulk. lalu kejar Jean.</b></font>

1112
01:17:53.449 --> 01:17:56.664
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ada usul.
Dia biang kerusakannya.</b></font>

1113
01:17:56.689 --> 01:18:00.476
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau urus dia.
Aku basmi sumbernya. Paham?</b></font>

1114
01:18:00.709 --> 01:18:02.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau takut melawan Hulk?</b></font>

1115
01:18:04.126 --> 01:18:05.880
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Kurasa begitu.
- Tak masalah.</b></font>

1116
01:18:05.947 --> 01:18:07.020
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku yang urus.</b></font>

1117
01:18:07.594 --> 01:18:08.957
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Frank!
- Apa?</b></font>

1118
01:18:09.386 --> 01:18:10.792
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan bunuh dia.</b></font>

1119
01:18:11.112 --> 01:18:12.895
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau membuatku terharu lebay.</b></font>

1120
01:18:13.089 --> 01:18:15.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kautahu?
Akan kuurus caraku sendiri.</b></font>

1121
01:18:15.626 --> 01:18:16.995
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Menyingkir!</b></font>

1122
01:18:17.638 --> 01:18:19.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jaga jarak 10 meter!</b></font>

1123
01:18:20.232 --> 01:18:21.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia sungguh merepotkan!</b></font>

1124
01:18:36.820 --> 01:18:37.927
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hei.</b></font>

1125
01:18:42.422 --> 01:18:43.662
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Wah.</b></font>

1126
01:18:44.008 --> 01:18:46.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ada yang babak belur nih.</b></font>

1127
01:18:48.761 --> 01:18:50.067
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Oh. tidak.</b></font>

1128
01:18:50.376 --> 01:18:51.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan. hentikan.</b></font>

1129
01:18:52.102 --> 01:18:53.475
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Gawat.</b></font>

1130
01:18:53.876 --> 01:18:54.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dokter Banner?</b></font>

1131
01:18:55.709 --> 01:18:56.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu kau?</b></font>

1132
01:18:57.362 --> 01:19:00.867
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Spider-Man! Apa yang terjadi?
Aku di mana?</b></font>

1133
01:19:01.792 --> 01:19:04.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini ulahku?
Ada korban luka?</b></font>

1134
01:19:04.707 --> 01:19:07.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia yang mengendalikanmu.</b></font>

1135
01:19:07.209 --> 01:19:09.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Alat penghambatku hilang.
- Ini.</b></font>

1136
01:19:09.282 --> 01:19:11.595
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hanya itu penahan monsternya.</b></font>

1137
01:19:11.709 --> 01:19:13.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kupunya cadangannya. pakailah.</b></font>

1138
01:19:13.619 --> 01:19:15.329
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Apa ini?
- Model universal.</b></font>

1139
01:19:15.443 --> 01:19:16.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pasti ampuh.</b></font>

1140
01:19:26.819 --> 01:19:29.702
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Banyak orang di gedung ini.
Pakailah.</b></font>

1141
01:19:32.876 --> 01:19:33.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau baik saja?</b></font>

1142
01:19:34.042 --> 01:19:37.177
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kepalaku...
Dia merusak sesuatu.</b></font>

1143
01:19:37.459 --> 01:19:38.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia mengendalikanmu?</b></font>

1144
01:19:38.696 --> 01:19:41.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukan. ini hal lain.</b></font>

1145
01:19:41.792 --> 01:19:45.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bruce. aku bisa bantu.
tapi pasanglah alatnya.</b></font>

1146
01:19:46.209 --> 01:19:47.302
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lepaskan!</b></font>

1147
01:19:49.339 --> 01:19:50.539
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia datang.</b></font>

1148
01:19:51.376 --> 01:19:53.085
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku lepas kendali.</b></font>

1149
01:19:53.542 --> 01:19:55.402
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau bisa menguasainya. Bruce!</b></font>

1150
01:19:55.427 --> 01:19:56.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pergi dari gedung ini!</b></font>

1151
01:19:57.354 --> 01:19:58.794
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tinggalkan gedung ini!</b></font>

1152
01:19:59.001 --> 01:20:01.014
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Evakuasi semua orang...</b></font>

1153
01:20:06.542 --> 01:20:08.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Banner. tatap aku.</b></font>

1154
01:20:10.959 --> 01:20:12.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukan Banner.</b></font>

1155
01:20:12.709 --> 01:20:13.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukan si wanita.</b></font>

1156
01:20:15.252 --> 01:20:16.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hanya Hulk.</b></font>

1157
01:20:26.959 --> 01:20:28.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kukira kau tidak sebesar ini.</b></font>

1158
01:20:33.442 --> 01:20:34.662
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Wuih.</b></font>

1159
01:20:35.042 --> 01:20:36.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Semoga beruntung. Peter.</b></font>

1160
01:20:46.269 --> 01:20:47.389
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini dia.</b></font>

1161
01:20:48.541 --> 01:20:50.138
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Diam di tempat!</b></font>

1162
01:21:04.216 --> 01:21:05.290
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya ampun.</b></font>

1163
01:21:19.812 --> 01:21:21.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dilarang memakai peluru tajam.</b></font>

1164
01:21:34.209 --> 01:21:36.422
<font color="#fff22f"><b><i>Hitung mundur ledakan dimulai.</i></b></font>

1165
01:22:05.509 --> 01:22:07.201
<font color="#fff22f"><b><i>Ledakan dalam 90 detik.</i></b></font>

1166
01:22:07.322 --> 01:22:08.666
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tahu!</b></font>

1167
01:22:14.556 --> 01:22:15.184
<font color="#26ff77"><b>GAGAL TERSAMBUNG</b></font>

1168
01:22:15.209 --> 01:22:16.616
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kulitmu tebal juga!</b></font>

1169
01:22:16.887 --> 01:22:17.940
<font color="#fff22f"><b><i>Alat penghambat gagal terpasang.</i></b></font>

1170
01:22:18.455 --> 01:22:19.515
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ayolah.</b></font>

1171
01:22:56.501 --> 01:22:57.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dokter Banner.</b></font>

1172
01:22:58.499 --> 01:22:59.420
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kumohon!</b></font>

1173
01:23:01.285 --> 01:23:02.060
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bruce...</b></font>

1174
01:23:03.376 --> 01:23:04.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini Peter.</b></font>

1175
01:23:06.042 --> 01:23:07.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku kawanmu.</b></font>

1176
01:23:35.641 --> 01:23:36.615
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bruce!</b></font>

1177
01:23:55.126 --> 01:23:57.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Buang senjata
atau kutembak kepalanya.</b></font>

1178
01:24:08.604 --> 01:24:09.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana dia?</b></font>

1179
01:24:23.173 --> 01:24:24.017
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang....?</b></font>

1180
01:24:24.042 --> 01:24:25.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudah usai. Jean.</b></font>

1181
01:24:40.502 --> 01:24:41.584
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sara...</b></font>

1182
01:24:53.126 --> 01:24:54.417
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu senapanku?</b></font>

1183
01:25:03.695 --> 01:25:04.861
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ada yang terluka?</b></font>

1184
01:25:05.414 --> 01:25:06.688
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hanya aku?</b></font>

1185
01:25:07.292 --> 01:25:08.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tiada korban lain?</b></font>

1186
01:25:10.376 --> 01:25:11.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Spider-Man!</b></font>

1187
01:25:14.209 --> 01:25:15.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau menyelamatkanku.</b></font>

1188
01:25:16.209 --> 01:25:17.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan banyak orang lain.</b></font>

1189
01:25:17.965 --> 01:25:21.002
<font color="#fff22f"><b>cegah dia memperoleh
benda incarannya.</b></font>

1190
01:25:23.136 --> 01:25:25.490
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sebelum pingsan. dia bicara.</b></font>

1191
01:25:26.369 --> 01:25:29.423
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Katanya "Sara". Kau kenal?</b></font>

1192
01:25:30.626 --> 01:25:32.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sebelum kau memasang alat penghambat.</b></font>

1193
01:25:33.459 --> 01:25:35.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dia sempat menguasai pikiranku.</b></font>

1194
01:25:37.042 --> 01:25:41.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sara itu nama rekanku
yang baru wafat.</b></font>

1195
01:25:41.499 --> 01:25:42.868
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Turut berduka.</b></font>

1196
01:25:43.959 --> 01:25:46.341
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kenangan Sara pasti</b></font>

1197
01:25:47.126 --> 01:25:48.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mengacaukan benaknya.</b></font>

1198
01:25:51.027 --> 01:25:53.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku mau interogasi
saat dia siuman.</b></font>

1199
01:25:53.874 --> 01:25:55.767
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tentu. Dia akan dipindah</b></font>

1200
01:25:55.792 --> 01:25:57.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>ke markas kami di Pulau Roosevelt.</b></font>

1201
01:25:58.172 --> 01:26:00.472
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku pun tak sabar mendengar celotehnya.</b></font>

1202
01:26:00.812 --> 01:26:02.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tapi biarkan dia pulih dulu.</b></font>

1203
01:26:03.287 --> 01:26:04.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tentu saja.</b></font>

1204
01:26:05.209 --> 01:26:06.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Terima kasih. Spider-Man.</b></font>

1205
01:26:06.626 --> 01:26:07.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sama-sama.</b></font>

1206
01:26:19.959 --> 01:26:20.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>MJ!</b></font>

1207
01:26:21.027 --> 01:26:24.708
