Ibu tak selayaknya begitu.</b></font>

1403
01:39:06.579 --> 01:39:08.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Misal anakmu persis kita?</b></font>

1404
01:39:09.420 --> 01:39:10.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pasti kucintai mereka.</b></font>

1405
01:39:14.292 --> 01:39:16.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Terutama si rambut merah.
