<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sara!</b></font>

1412
01:40:08.459 --> 01:40:09.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maafkan aku. Jean.</b></font>

1413
01:40:10.542 --> 01:40:12.148
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku harus melindungimu.</b></font>

1414
01:40:52.959 --> 01:40:53.791
