1421
01:41:20.292 --> 01:41:21.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Semua aman. tenanglah.</b></font>

1422
01:41:24.126 --> 01:41:25.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana dia?</b></font>

