1429
01:41:43.292 --> 01:41:45.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang mengerti penggunaannya.</b></font>

1430
01:41:53.400 --> 01:41:54.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana saudariku?</b></font>

1431
01:41:57.792 --> 01:41:59.874
