1446
01:43:08.876 --> 01:43:09.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>12 meter.</b></font>

1447
01:43:09.792 --> 01:43:11.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kunci ruangan.</b></font>

1448
01:43:11.464 --> 01:43:12.417
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Terkunci.</b></font>

1449
01:43:18.126 --> 01:43:19.791
