1454
01:43:46.778 --> 01:43:48.192
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tidak tahu.</b></font>

1455
01:43:48.331 --> 01:43:49.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia mengirimiku pesan.</b></font>

1456
01:43:50.876 --> 01:43:52.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Supaya aku membantu mencarinya.</b></font>

1457
01:43:53.626 --> 01:43:57.541
