1469
01:44:33.626 --> 01:44:36.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bakal kita terapkan</b></font>

1470
01:44:36.792 --> 01:44:38.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>pada otak pilihan kita.</b></font>

1471
01:44:40.269 --> 01:44:43.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Alat ini warisan
 saudarimu.</b></font>

1472
01:44:44.292 --> 01:44:47.041
