1474
01:44:53.643 --> 01:44:54.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa maksudmu?</b></font>

1475
01:44:56.459 --> 01:44:58.000
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mulai lompatan pertama.</b></font>

1476
01:45:02.369 --> 01:45:06.885
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa itu V-Max? 
Tempat dia dikurung.</b></font>

1477
01:45:21.542 --> 01:45:22.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lompatan pertama.</b></font>

1478
01:45:24.862 --> 01:45:25.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siap.</b></font>

1479
01:45:26.292 --> 01:45:28.909
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Akses dikunci. 
Proses dimulai.</b></font>

1480
01:45:29.292 --> 01:45:30.541
