1481
01:45:31.676 --> 01:45:33.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mukamu tegang begitu. ada apa?</b></font>

1482
01:45:35.032 --> 01:45:36.120
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tenanglah!</b></font>

1483
01:45:36.376 --> 01:45:38.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku kawan Damage Control. 
