1484
01:45:42.959 --> 01:45:45.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mau main kasar? 
Baiklah.</b></font>

1485
01:45:46.126 --> 01:45:47.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sebentar saja.</b></font>

1486
01:45:48.126 --> 01:45:49.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sebentar.</b></font>

1487
01:45:50.090 --> 01:45:51.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Masa SMA sudah lama berlalu.</b></font>

1488
01:45:53.626 --> 01:45:54.791
