1489
01:45:55.142 --> 01:45:56.455
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sebaiknya begitu.</b></font>

1490
01:45:57.149 --> 01:45:59.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian tidak pegal? Rasanya enak.</b></font>

