01:46:35.876 --> 01:46:37.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lompatan 26.</b></font>

1496
01:46:37.292 --> 01:46:38.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Perekaman berjalan.</b></font>

1497
01:46:38.633 --> 01:46:39.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maaf. Pak.</b></font>

1498
01:46:40.480 --> 01:46:41.447
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Penyusup masuk.</b></font>

1499
01:46:46.635 --> 01:46:47.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tebakanmu benar.</b></font>

1500
01:46:48.082 --> 01:46:49.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia lebih tangguh dari saudarinya.</b></font>

1501
01:46:50.792 --> 01:46:51.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Naikkan frekuensinya.</b></font>

1502
01:46:53.542 --> 01:46:55.160
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagus sekali. Jean.</b></font>

1503
01:47:33.183 --> 01:47:35.523
<font color="#26ff77"><b>V____ MAX</b></font>

1504
01:47:41.459 --> 01:47:42.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jean?</b></font>

1505
01:47:47.042 --> 01:47:48.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jean. kaudengar aku?</b></font>

1506
