1511
01:48:15.391 --> 01:48:16.197
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hentikan.</b></font>

1512
01:48:16.577 --> 01:48:17.337
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kucoba.</b></font>

1513
01:48:17.542 --> 01:48:18.404
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana bisa?</b></font>

