01:48:19.052 --> 01:48:23.842
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ruangan ini pemandangan terakhir saudariku!</b></font>

1515
01:48:23.939 --> 01:48:24.794
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hentikan semuanya!</b></font>

1516
01:48:24.819 --> 01:48:25.614
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mustahil.</b></font>

1517
01:48:27.459 --> 01:48:28.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Menyingkir.</b></font>

1518
01:48:30.051 --> 01:48:32.434
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak kubiarkan kau melakukannya.</b></font>

1519
01:48:36.071 --> 01:48:39.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hanya aku pelindung 
