1522
01:50:55.548 --> 01:50:58.075
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jean. aku datang menolongmu.</b></font>

1523
01:50:59.376 --> 01:51:00.638
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau yang membuangku ke sini.</b></font>

1524
01:51:01.376 --> 01:51:05.041
