1526
01:51:12.402 --> 01:51:14.174
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Merekalah yang wajib diselamatkan.</b></font>

1527
01:51:14.626 --> 01:51:15.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sekarang.</b></font>

1528
01:51:16.112 --> 01:51:16.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kau juga.</b></font>

1529
01:51:19.706 --> 01:51:20.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mulai.</b></font>

1530
01:51:34.542 --> 01:51:35.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Keren banget.</b></font>

1531
01:51:55.693 --> 01:51:57.652
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jean. kumohon!</b></font>

1532
01:52:11.428 --> 01:52:12.455
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ayo. ayo...</b></font>

1533
01:52:32.730 --> 01:52:33.590
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa-apaan...</b></font>

1534
01:52:35.610 --> 01:52:36.663
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lucunya.</b></font>

1535
01:52:36.688 --> 01:52:39.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>teman Damage Control 
