01:52:51.126 --> 01:52:52.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Manusia itu jahat.</b></font>

1539
01:52:57.428 --> 01:52:58.634
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Waspadai mereka</b></font>

1540
