1546
01:53:26.017 --> 01:53:28.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cepat bergerak jika mau campur tangan.</b></font>

1547
01:53:28.412 --> 01:53:29.478
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sedang berusaha!</b></font>

