01:53:55.653 --> 01:53:56.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Nak?</b></font>

1549
01:53:57.126 --> 01:53:58.267
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Anjir!</b></font>

1550
01:54:33.292 --> 01:54:34.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saudariku tewas</b></font>

